    "created_at": "2016-09-15T14:56:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T14:56:02Z",
    "body": "Agreed, this needs to be clarified and re-organized.  I always interpreted this as meaning that the args are like restricted args that abort instead of throwing.  I will have to run some tests on various implementations to very whether that interpretation is interoperable.\n",
