    "created_at": "2016-09-15T16:13:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T16:13:58Z",
    "body": "WebKit (and likely Blink) do an early return in the implementation methods if the input value is non-finite. I personally prefer this compared to adding a Web IDL extension.\n",
