    "created_at": "2016-09-15T17:23:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T17:23:57Z",
    "body": "Alright then. The early exit in the steps is fine by me. In terms of spec readability, I was thinking that each affected method should have an explicitly documented early exit step, as opposed to the kind of blanket statement we have now, which is error prone.\n",
